<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>My heart is broken from my deepest need.</l><l>Don’t ask me, angels, why I’m weeping.</l><l>Nothing but Jesus fills my inner being.</l><l>Oh! Where’s my Love?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
